n\n\n### Prerequisites\n- [Entire CLI](https://entire.io/cli) installed\n- [OpenCode](https://opencode.ai) installed\n\n### Setup\n\n1. Initialize Entire in your repository:\n   ```bash\n   cd /path/to/your/project\n   entire setup\n   ```\n\n2. Add this plugin to OpenCode:\n   ```bash\n   # Add to opencode.json\n   {\n     \"plugin\": [\"opencode-entire-integration\"]\n   }\n   ```\n\n3. Start using OpenCode - sessions are automatically tracked!\n\n## Usage\n\n### View Session History\n```bash\nentire logs\n```\n\n### Rewind to Checkpoint\n```bash\nentire rewind\n# Select checkpoint from interactive list\n```\n\n### View Session Details\n```bash\nentire session <session-id>\n```\n\n## How It Works\n\n[Architecture diagram and explanation]\n\n## Configuration\n\n[Configuration options]\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n[Common issues and solutions]\n\n## Contributing\n\n[Contribution guidelines]\n```\n\n---\n\n## Risks & Mitigations\n\n### Risk: OpenCode API Changes\n\n**Impact:** Plugin breaks if OpenCode changes event schemas\n\n**Mitigation:**\n- Pin to specific OpenCode version in peerDependencies\n- Add schema validation for events\n- Monitor OpenCode releases for breaking changes\n- Maintain compatibility layer for multiple versions\n\n### Risk: Performance Overhead\n\n**Impact:** Hook execution slows down OpenCode\n\n**Mitigation:**\n- Make hooks async (don't block OpenCode)\n- Debounce rapid events\n- Profile and optimize bottlenecks\n- Add configuration to disable features\n\n### Risk: Transcript Export Failures\n\n**Impact:** Missing metadata for checkpoints\n\n**Mitigation:**\n- Graceful degradation (checkpoint without transcript)\n- Retry logic with exponential backoff\n- Log errors for user visibility\n- Validate exported files before proceeding\n\n### Risk: Command Not Found\n\n**Impact:** Plugin fails if entire CLI not in PATH\n\n**Mitigation:**\n- Check for entire CLI availability on plugin load\n- Provide clear error message with installation instructions\n- Support custom path configuration\n- Fallback to no-op if CLI unavailable (log warning)\n\n---\n\n## Success Criteria\n\n### Phase 1 (MVP)\n- [ ] OpenCode sessions appear in `entire logs`\n- [ ] Can create checkpoints via `entire hooks opencode stop`\n- [ ] Can rewind to any checkpoint\n- [ ] Transcripts exported correctly\n\n### Phase 2 (Task Tracking)\n- [ ] Subagent spawns create pre-task checkpoints\n- [ ] Subagent transcripts linked to tasks\n- [ ] `entire logs` shows task hierarchy\n- [ ] Can rewind to before/after task execution\n\n### Phase 3 (Enhanced Metadata)\n- [ ] Checkpoint messages include todo content\n- [ ] User prompts captured in metadata\n- [ ] Rich context in rewind point descriptions\n\n### Phase 4 (Production)\n- [ ] Published to NPM\n- [ ] Documentation complete\n- [ ] Integration tests passing\n- [ ] Performance benchmarks meet targets (< 100ms hook overhead)\n- [ ] Error handling covers all cases\n\n---\n\n## Timeline Estimate\n\n- **Phase 1 (MVP):** 2-3 weeks\n- **Phase 2 (Task Tracking):** 2 weeks\n- **Phase 3 (Enhanced Metadata):** 1-2 weeks\n- **Phase 4 (Production Polish):** 2-3 weeks\n\n**Total:** 7-10 weeks for full implementation\n\n**MVP to Production:** Could ship Phase 1 as alpha release, gather feedback, iterate\n\n---\n\n## Next Steps\n\n1. **Prototype:** Implement minimal plugin (session-start + stop hooks only)\n2. **Test:** Validate approach with real OpenCode sessions\n3. **Iterate:** Gather feedback, refine architecture\n4. **Implement:** Build out remaining phases\n5. **Document:** Write comprehensive docs\n6. **Release:** Publish to NPM, announce to users\n\n---\n\n## Questions for Review\n\n1. **Strategy preference:** Should we default to manual-commit or auto-commit for OpenCode integration?\n\n2. **Transcript format:** Should we convert OpenCode's format to Claude Code format, or keep native format?\n\n3. **Agent type:** Should Entire CLI have explicit \"opencode\" agent type, or treat it generically?\n\n4. **Session discovery:** How should `entire sessions` list OpenCode sessions? Parse exported transcripts?\n\n5. **Hook naming:** Is `entire hooks opencode` the right naming, or should it be more generic?\n\n6. **Configuration:** Should config live in `opencode.json`, `.entire/settings.json`, or both?\n\n7. **Error handling:** Should plugin fail loudly or gracefully degrade when Entire CLI unavailable?\n\n8. **Performance targets:** What's acceptable hook overhead? 50ms? 100ms? 500ms?\n"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":14,"cache_creation_input_tokens":68002,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":68002,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":9263,"service_tier":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011CWycv1KztHK9VTfQqFFoE","type":"assistant","uuid":"8a19b734-bc32-4f81-89d6-81f927892d0b","timestamp":"2026-01-10T11:31:45.530Z"}
