{"parentUuid":"437d2d92-a68e-4daf-9aff-d2b2614ba97e","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/Users/soph/Work/entire/devenv/cli","sessionId":"52c38054-a209-4b88-9a0d-d98ba15865dd","version":"2.1.3","gitBranch":"main","slug":"vectorized-weaving-quail","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929","id":"msg_012KbkgL4nhaRsqJP5gG4NNz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've completed a comprehensive investigation of integrating OpenCode with the Entire CLI. Here's what I've created:\n\n## Documents Created\n\n### 1. **Findings Document** (`docs/opencode-integration-findings.md`)\nA deep technical analysis covering:\n\n- **Architecture comparison** of both systems\n- **OpenCode plugin system** - event-driven with 20+ event types\n- **Entire CLI hook system** - git hooks + agent-specific hooks\n- **Three integration approaches** evaluated:\n  1. **OpenCode Plugin** (RECOMMENDED)\n  2. Entire Agent Adapter\n  3. Standalone Bridge Process\n- **Detailed compatibility analysis** including challenges and gaps\n- **Technical considerations** (session mapping, transcript export, performance)\n\n### 2. **Implementation Plan** (`docs/opencode-integration-plan.md`)\nA concrete implementation roadmap with:\n\n- **4-phase development plan** (7-10 weeks total)\n  - Phase 1: MVP with core session tracking\n  - Phase 2: Task/subagent tracking\n  - Phase 3: Enhanced metadata (todos, prompts)\n  - Phase 4: Production polish\n- **Complete code samples** in both Go and TypeScript\n- **Testing strategy** with example unit and integration tests\n- **Deployment guide** including NPM packaging and CI/CD\n- **Risk mitigation strategies**\n\n## Key Recommendation: OpenCode Plugin Approach\n\nI recommend writing an **OpenCode plugin** (`opencode-entire-integration`) that:\n\n1. Subscribes to OpenCode events (`session.created`, `tool.execute.before/after`, etc.)\n2. Spawns `entire hooks opencode <hook-name>` commands with JSON input\n3. Exports OpenCode