- Cons: More code, but most robust\n\nI think Approach C (hybrid) is best. Let me document this.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":10,"cache_creation_input_tokens":69,"cache_read_input_tokens":77670,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":69,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011CWydRm6KxH3rtmAeqKojj","type":"assistant","uuid":"bfa5b076-5fa9-40a0-8c3d-b74014f64a62","timestamp":"2026-01-10T11:36:24.058Z"}
