code samples in Go and TypeScript\n- Testing strategy and examples\n- Deployment and NPM packaging guide\n- Risk mitigation strategies\n\n**Read this if:** You're ready to implement the integration.\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start: What We're Building\n\n### Architecture\n```\n┌──────────────────────┐\n│   OpenCode CLI       │\n│   (TypeScript/Bun)   │\n└─────────┬────────────┘\n          │\n          │ publishes events\n          ▼\n┌──────────────────────┐\n│  Entire Plugin       │\n│  (TypeScript)        │\n│  - Subscribes to     │\n│    OpenCode events   │\n│  - Exports session   │\n│    transcripts       │\n└─────────┬────────────┘\n          │\n          │ spawns commands\n          │ with JSON input\n          ▼\n┌──────────────────────┐\n│  Entire CLI          │\n│  (Go)                │\n│  - Git operations    │\n│  - Strategy system   │\n│  - Checkpoint mgmt   │\n└──────────────────────┘\n```\n\n### User Installation Flow\n```bash\n# 1. Install both tools\ngo install entire.io/cli/cmd/entire@latest\nbrew install opencode  # or equivalent\n\n# 2. Setup in repository\ncd my-project\nentire setup\n\n# 3. Setup OpenCode integration (installs plugin automatically)\nentire opencode setup\n\n# 4. Use OpenCode - sessions tracked automatically!\nopencode\n\n# 5. Manage sessions\nentire logs\nentire rewind\n```\n\n### What Users Get\n\n**Automatic Session Tracking:**\n- Every OpenCode session creates git checkpoints\n- Subagent work tracked separately\n- Full transcript history preserved\n\n**Git-Based Version Control:**\n- Rewind to any point in development\n- Shadow branches keep work history clean\n- Metadata stored on separate branch\n\n**Unified Management:**\n- One CLI for all AI agent sessions (Claude Code, OpenCode, etc.)\n- Consistent workflow across tools\n- Familiar git-style interface\n\n---\n\n## Implementation Phases\n\n### Phase 1: MVP (2-3 weeks)\n- Basic session tracking\n- `entire opencode setup` command\n- Core plugin hooks (session-start, stop)\n- Export transcripts\n\n**Milestone:** OpenCode sessions appear in `entire logs`\n\n### Phase 2: Task Tracking (2 weeks)\n- Subagent spawn/completion tracking\n- Task metadata storage\n- Pre-task and post-task hooks\n\n**Milestone:** Subagent work tracked as separate checkpoints\n\n### Phase 3: Enhanced Metadata (1-2 weeks)\n- Todo content in checkpoint messages\n- User prompt tracking\n- Rich rewind point descriptions\n\n**Milestone:** Better context for every checkpoint\n\n### Phase 4: Production (2-3 weeks)\n- Error handling and retry logic\n- Performance optimization\n- Documentation and examples\n- NPM package published\n\n**Milestone:** Production-ready integration\n\n---\n\n## Key Components\n\n### Entire CLI Side\n\n**New Commands:**\n```bash\nentire opencode setup    # Install and configure plugin\nentire opencode status   # Check integration status\nentire hooks opencode session-start\nentire hooks opencode stop\nentire hooks opencode pre-task\nentire hooks opencode post-task\nentire hooks opencode post-todo\n```\n\n**New Agent Type:**\n```go\n// cmd/entire/cli/agent/opencode/\ntype OpenCodeAgent struct{}\n\nfunc (o *OpenCodeAgent) Name() string {\n    return \"OpenCode\"\n}\n```\n\n**Directory Structure:**\n```\ncmd/entire/cli/\n├── opencode_setup_cmd.go        # Setup commands\n├── hooks_opencode_cmd.go        # Hook commands\n├── hooks_opencode_handlers.go   # Hook implementations\n└── agent/opencode/\n    ├── opencode.go              # Agent implementation\n    ├── types.go                 # Types\n    ├── hooks.go                 # HookHandler\n    └── session.go               # Session discovery\n```\n\n### Plugin Side\n\n**NPM Package:** `opencode-entire-integration`\n\n**Main Plugin:**\n```typescript\nexport const EntireIntegrationPlugin: Plugin = async (ctx) => {\n  // Check for Entire CLI\n  // Subscribe to OpenCode events\n  // Call Entire CLI hooks\n  return {\n    \"session.created\": onSessionCreated,\n    \"session.idle\": onSessionIdle,\n    \"tool.execute.before\": onPreTask,\n    \"tool.execute.after\": onPostTask,\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Directory Structure:**\n```\nopencode-entire-integration/\n├── src/\n│   ├── index.ts                # Main plugin\n│   ├── hooks/\n│   │   ├── session.ts          # Session hooks\n│   │   ├── task.ts             # Task hooks\n│   │   └── todo.ts             # Todo hooks\n│   ├── export/\n│   │   └── transcript.ts       # Export sessions\n│   └── cli/\n│       └── entire.ts           # CLI wrapper\n└── tests/\n```\n\n---\n\n## Configuration\n\n### .entire/settings.json (Core Entire Config)\n```json\n{\n  \"strategy\": \"manual-commit\",\n  \"local_dev\": false\n}\n```\n\n### .entire/opencode/config.json (OpenCode Integration Config)\n```json\n{\n  \"enable_task_tracking\": true,\n  \"enable_todo_tracking\": true,\n  \"export_transcripts\": true,\n  \"hook_timeout_ms\": 5000,\n  \"log_level\": \"info\",\n  \"debounce_ms\": 500\n}\n```\n\n### opencode.json (OpenCode Config)\n```json\n{\n  \"plugin\": [\"opencode-entire-integration\"]\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Event Mapping\n\n| OpenCode Event | Entire Hook | Purpose |\n|----------------|-------------|---------|\n| `session.created` | `session-start` | Initialize session tracking |\n| `session.idle` | `stop` | Save checkpoint on idle |\n| `tool.execute.before` (Task) | `pre-task` | Checkpoint before subagent |\n| `tool.execute.after` (Task) | `post-task` | Link subagent transcript |\n| `tool.execute.after` (TodoWrite) | `post-todo` | Update checkpoint description |\n\n---\n\n## Error Handling Strategy\n\n### Plugin Side (TypeScript)\n- Check for Entire CLI on initialization\n- Log clear error messages to OpenCode logs\n- Gracefully degrade (return empty hooks) if missing\n- Provide installation instructions\n\n### CLI Side (Go)\n- `entire opencode setup` checks prerequisites\n- `entire opencode status` shows integration health\n- Clear error messages with actionable steps\n- Non-blocking failures (warn but continue)\n\n---\n\n## Testin