{"parentUuid":"4e34f699-87c1-42dc-88fc-065b9bcb8f1b","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/Users/soph/Work/entire/devenv/opencode-entire-integration","sessionId":"52c38054-a209-4b88-9a0d-d98ba15865dd","version":"2.1.3","gitBranch":"main","slug":"vectorized-weaving-quail","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FW2ASmT6wgpbw9rkN9A63Q","type":"tool_result","content":"# OpenCode SDK Client API Documentation\n\n## Overview\nThe OpenCode SDK is a type-safe JavaScript/TypeScript client for interacting with the OpenCode server. Install it via `npm install @opencode-ai/sdk` and create instances to \"build integrations and control opencode programmatically.\"\n\n## Creating a Client\n\n**Full setup** (starts server + client):\n```javascript\nimport { createOpencode } from \"@opencode-ai/sdk\"\nconst { client } = await createOpencode()\n```\n\n**Client-only** (connect to existing server):\n```javascript\nimport { createOpencodeClient } from \"@opencode-ai/sdk\"\nconst client = createOpencodeClient({\n  baseUrl: \"http://localhost:4096\"\n})\n```\n\n## Core API Methods\n\n**Sessions** - The primary data structure:\n- `session.list()` - retrieve all sessions\n- `session.get({ path })` - fetch specific session\n- `session.create({ body })` - initialize new session\n- `session.prompt({ path, body })` - send messages and receive AI responses\n- `session.messages({ path })` - list all messages in a session\n- `session.message({ path })` - get individual message details\n\n**Files & Search**:\n- `find.text({ query })` - search file contents\n- `file.read({ query })` - read file contents\n- `find.files({ query })` - locate files by name\n\n**Project & Config**:\n- `project.current()` - get active project\n- `config.get()` - retrieve configuration\n- `config.providers()` - list available AI providers\n\n**TUI Control** - programmatically control the interface:\n- `tui.appendPrompt({ body })` - add text to prompt\n- `tui.submitPrompt()` - trigger submission\n- `tui.showToast({ body })` - display notifications\n\n## Example Usage\n\n```javascript\n// Create session and send prompt\nconst session = await client.session.create({\n  body: { title: \"My session\" }\n})\n\nconst result = await client.session.prompt({\n  path: { id: session.id },\n  body: {\n    model: { providerID: \"anthropic\", modelID: \"claude-3-5-sonnet\" },\n    parts: [{ type: \"text\", text: \"Hello!\" }]\n  }\n})\n```"}]},"uuid":"01637825-9be0-4f88-9303-eafaa7835b00","timestamp":"2026-01-10T16:31:56.510Z","toolUseResult":{"bytes":93870,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# OpenCode SDK Client API Documentation\n\n## Overview\nThe OpenCode SDK is a type-safe JavaScript/TypeScript client for interacting with the OpenCode server. Install it via `npm install @opencode-ai/sdk` and create instances to \"build integrations and control opencode programmatically.\"\n\n## Creating a Client\n\n**Full setup** (starts server + client):\n```javascript\nimport { createOpencode } from \"@opencode-ai/sdk\"\nconst { client } = await createOpencode()\n```\n\n**Client-only** (connect to existing server):\n```javascript\nimport { createOpencodeClient } from \"@opencode-ai/sdk\"\nconst client = createOpencodeClient({\n  baseUrl: \"http://localhost:4096\"\n})\n```\n\n## Core API Methods\n\n**Sessions** - The primary data structure:\n- `session.list()` - retrieve all sessions\n- `session.get({ path })` - fetch specific session\n- `session.create({ body })` - initialize new session\n- `session.prompt({ path, body })` - send messages and receive AI responses\n- `session.messages({ path })` - list all messages in a session\n- `session.message({ path })` - get individual message details\n\n**Files & Search**:\n- `find.text({ query })` - search file contents\n- `file.read({ query })` - read file contents\n- `find.files({ query })` - locate files by name\n\n**Project & Config**:\n- `project.current()` - get active project\n- `config.get()` - retrieve configuration\n- `config.providers()` - list available AI providers\n\n**TUI Control** - programmatically control the interface:\n- `tui.appendPrompt({ body })` - add text to prompt\n- `tui.submitPrompt()` - trigger submission\n- `tui.showToast({ body })` - display notifications\n\n## Example Usage\n\n```javascript\n// Create session and send prompt\nconst session = await client.session.create({\n  body: { title: \"My session\" }\n})\n\nconst result = await client.session.prompt({\n  path: { id: session.id },\n  body: {\n    model: { providerID: \"anthropic\", modelID: \"claude-3-5-sonnet\" },\n    parts: [{ type: \"text\", text: \"Hello!\" }]\n  }\n})\n```","durationMs":6276,"url":"https://opencode.ai/docs/sdk"},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"4e34f699-87c1-42dc-88fc-065b9bcb8f1b"}
