] Input: { ... }\n[entire-integration] Hook exit code: 0\n[entire-integration] Hook completed\n```\n\nThen check:\n```bash\n# Check current session was set\ncat .git/entire-sessions/current_session\n\n# Check exported transcripts\nls -la .entire/opencode/sessions/\n\n# Check git branches (shadow branches)\ngit branch -a | grep entire\n\n# View session logs\nentire logs\n```\n\nLet me know what you see!"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":5,"cache_creation_input_tokens":130,"cache_read_input_tokens":113321,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":130,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":574,"service_tier":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011CWz75XBNbnLLktmwCxMK3","type":"assistant","uuid":"be1d7ef6-1a2c-4c19-bc6b-c871ab9f926c","timestamp":"2026-01-10T17:39:04.812Z"}
