{"parentUuid":"0e293ff9-5e4c-4189-861b-332ca76d71fc","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/Users/soph/Work/entire/devenv/opencode-entire-integration","sessionId":"52c38054-a209-4b88-9a0d-d98ba15865dd","version":"2.1.3","gitBranch":"soph/opencode","slug":"vectorized-weaving-quail","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929","id":"msg_0133TUurhhjDPi46qyNHa27F","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! I've fixed the critical bug. Here's what was wrong and what I fixed:\n\n## The Problem\n\nThe `handleOpencodeStop()` function was calling `GetAgent()` which auto-detects the agent based on the environment. Since I'm running from Claude Code, it was detecting `ClaudeCodeAgent` instead of `OpenCodeAgent`. \n\nThe `ClaudeCodeAgent.ParseHookInput()` creates an empty `RawData` map and never populates `transcript_path`, which caused the \"transcript_path not found in hook input\" error.\n\n## The Fix\n\nChanged both OpenCode hook handlers (`hooks_opencode_handlers.go:24` and `:81`) to explicitly use `OpenCodeAgent`:\n\n```go\n// Before:\nag, err := GetAgent()\n\n// After:\nag, err := agent.Get(agent.AgentNameOpenCode)\n```\n\nThis ensures the correct agent's `ParseHookInput()` is called, which properly populates `RawData[\"transcript_path\"]`.\n\n## Testing\n\nThe fix is now installed and working:\n\n```bash\n$ cd /Users/soph/Work/entire/test/opencode_test && \\\n  cat /tmp/test-hook-input.json | entire hooks opencode stop\n\nRead OpenCode session from: .../transcript.jsonl\nCommitted changes to shadow branch 'entire/137a907'\nCreated checkpoint for OpenCode session: 2026-01-10-ses_test123\n```\n\nThe checkpoint is successfully created on the shadow branch!\n\n## Next Steps\n\nThe CLI fix is installed. To test with a real OpenCode session, the user needs to:\n\n1. Configure the OpenCode plugin in their test repo's `.opencode` directory\n2. Start an OpenCode session in that repo\n3. Make some changes and let the session go idle\n4. Check that `entire log` shows the checkpoint\n\nThe plugin code in `opencode-entire-integration` has been rebuilt and is ready to use."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":12,"cache_creation_input_tokens":201,"cache_read_input_tokens":65415,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":201,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":612,"service_tier":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011CWzJcPC3nnT5gFqpEhhxY","type":"assistant","uuid":"d8f6792e-68e6-4b0e-849f-b8f6a03772cf","timestamp":"2026-01-10T20:10:20.397Z"}
