md","content":"# OpenCode Entire Integration\n\nTrack your OpenCode sessions with git-based version control using Entire CLI.\n\n## What is this?\n\nThis plugin connects [OpenCode](https://opencode.ai) (multi-agent AI CLI) with [Entire CLI](https://entire.io/cli) (git session manager) to:\n\n- 📝 Track all your OpenCode sessions as git checkpoints\n- ⏮️ Rewind to any point in your AI-assisted development\n- 🔗 Link subagent work to parent sessions (coming in Phase 2)\n- 📊 Export session transcripts for review and analysis\n\n## Status\n\n**Phase 1 MVP** - Basic session tracking implemented\n\n- ✅ Session lifecycle tracking (created, idle)\n- ✅ Transcript export to `.entire/opencode/sessions/`\n- ✅ Integration with Entire CLI git strategies\n- ✅ Error handling with clear user messages\n- ⏳ Task tracking (Phase 2)\n- ⏳ Todo metadata (Phase 3)\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- [Entire CLI](https://entire.io/cli) installed\n- [OpenCode](https://opencode.ai) installed\n- [Bun](https://bun.sh) runtime\n- Git repository\n\n## Installation\n\n### Option A: Automatic Setup (Recommended)\n\n```bash\n# 1. Install Entire CLI if you haven't already\ngo install entire.io/cli/cmd/entire@latest\n\n# 2. Setup Entire in your repository\ncd /path/to/your/project\nentire setup\n\n# 3. Install and configure the plugin (coming soon)\nentire opencode setup\n```\n\n### Option B: Manual Installation\n\n```bash\n# 1. Install the plugin\ncd ~/.config/opencode\nbun add opencode-entire-integration\n\n# 2. Add to your opencode.json\n{\n  \"plugin\": [\"opencode-entire-integration\"]\n}\n\n# 3. Make sure Entire CLI is set up in your project\ncd /path/to/your/project\nentire setup\n```\n\n## Usage\n\nOnce installed, the plugin works automatically:\n\n```bash\n# Start OpenCode - sessions are tracked automatically\nopencode\n\n# In another terminal, view your session history\nentire logs\n\n# Rewind to any checkpoint\nentire rewind\n\n# View session details\nentire session <session-id>\n```\n\n## Configuration\n\nCreate `.entire/opencode/config.json` in your repository to customize behavior:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"enable_task_tracking\": true,\n  \"enable_todo_tracking\": true,\n  \"export_transcripts\": true,\n  \"hook_timeout_ms\": 5000,\n  \"log_level\": \"info\",\n  \"debounce_ms\": 500\n}\n```\n\n### Configuration Options\n\n| Option | Type | Default | Description |","numLines":100,"startLine":1,"totalLines":317}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"07177c7d-f73d-42ba-b4db-bf2457701a83"}
