{"parentUuid":"24235ae8-3023-4d32-92b3-b7b4df93f251","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/Users/soph/Work/entire/devenv/cli","sessionId":"52c38054-a209-4b88-9a0d-d98ba15865dd","version":"2.1.3","gitBranch":"soph/opencode","slug":"vectorized-weaving-quail","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01YT19MLFScy7GQUVrRZo1Xd","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /Users/soph/Work/entire/devenv/opencode-entire-integration/README.md has been updated successfully."}]},"uuid":"949fd8c0-9ed4-4eac-a6e4-719fb2a88db8","timestamp":"2026-01-10T20:59:12.987Z","toolUseResult":{"filePath":"/Users/soph/Work/entire/devenv/opencode-entire-integration/README.md","oldString":"1. **OpenCode event** → `session.created`\n2. **Plugin hook** → `onSessionCreated()`\n3. **Export transcript** → `.entire/opencode/sessions/<id>/transcript.jsonl`\n4. **Call Entire CLI** → `entire hooks opencode session-start`","newString":"1. **OpenCode event** → `session.created`\n2. **Plugin hook** → `onSessionCreated()`\n3. **Export transcript** → `.entire/tmp/opencode/sessions/<id>/transcript.jsonl`\n4. **Call Entire CLI** → `entire hooks opencode session-start`","originalFile":"# OpenCode Entire Integration\n\nTrack your OpenCode sessions with git-based version control using Entire CLI.\n\n## What is this?\n\nThis plugin connects [OpenCode](https://opencode.ai) (multi-agent AI CLI) with [Entire CLI](https://entire.io/cli) (git session manager) to:\n\n- 📝 Track all your OpenCode sessions as git checkpoints\n- ⏮️ Rewind to any point in your AI-assisted development\n- 🔗 Link subagent work to parent sessions (coming in Phase 2)\n- 📊 Export session transcripts for review and analysis\n\n## Status\n\n**Phase 1 MVP** - Basic session tracking implemented\n\n- ✅ Session lifecycle tracking (created, idle)\n- ✅ Transcript export to `.entire/tmp/opencode/sessions/` (temporary)\n- ✅ Integration with Entire CLI git strategies\n- ✅ Error handling with clear user messages\n- ⏳ Task tracking (Phase 2)\n- ⏳ Todo metadata (Phase 3)\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- [Entire CLI](https://entire.io/cli) installed\n- [OpenCode](https://opencode.ai) installed\n- [Bun](https://bun.sh) runtime\n- Git repository\n\n## Installation\n\n### Option A: Automatic Setup (Recommended)\n\n```bash\n# 1. Install Entire CLI if you haven't already\ngo install entire.io/cli/cmd/entire@latest\n\n# 2. Setup Entire in your repository\ncd /path/to/your/project\nentire setup\n\n# 3. Install and configure the plugin (coming soon)\nentire opencode setup\n```\n\n### Option B: Manual Installation\n\n```bash\n# 1. Install the plugin\ncd ~/.config/opencode\nbun add opencode-entire-integration\n\n# 2. Add to your opencode.json\n{\n  \"plugin\": [\"opencode-entire-integration\"]\n}\n\n# 3. Make sure Entire CLI is set up in your project\ncd /path/to/your/project\nentire setup\n```\n\n## Usage\n\nOnce installed, the plugin works automatically:\n\n```bash\n# Start OpenCode - sessions are tracked automatically\nopencode\n\n# In another terminal, view your session history\nentire logs\n\n# Rewind to any checkpoint\nentire rewind\n\n# View session details\nentire session <session-id>\n```\n\n## Configuration\n\nCreate `.entire/opencode/config.json` in your repository to customize behavior:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"enable_task_tracking\": true,\n  \"enable_todo_tracking\": true,\n  \"export_transcripts\": true,\n  \"hook_timeout_ms\": 5000,\n  \"log_level\": \"info\",\n  \"debounce_ms\": 500\n}\n```\n\n### Configuration Options\n\n| Option | Type | Default | Description |\n|--------|------|---------|-------------|\n| `enable_task_tracking` | boolean | `true` | Track subagent spawns (Phase 2) |\n| `enable_todo_tracking` | boolean | `true` | Extract todo metadata (Phase 3) |\n| `export_transcripts` | boolean | `true` | Export session transcripts to files |\n| `hook_timeout_ms` | number | `5000` | Hook execution timeout |\n| `log_level` | string | `\"info\"` | Log level: debug, info, warn, error |\n| `debounce_ms` | number | `500` | Debounce rapid events (future use) |\n\n## How It Works\n\n```\nOpenCode CLI → Plugin (TypeScript) → Entire CLI (Go) → Git Operations\n     ↓              ↓                        ↓                  ↓\n  Events     Translate Events      Strategy Pattern      Shadow Branches\n             Export Transcripts    Handle Git Ops        Metadata Storage\n```\n\n1. **OpenCode** publishes events when sessions start, end, tools execute, etc.\n2. **Plugin** subscribes to these events and exports session data\n3. **Entire CLI** receives hook calls and performs git operations\n4. **Git** stores session history in shadow branches with metadata\n\n## Directory Structure\n\n```\nyour-project/\n├── .entire/\n│   ├── settings.json           # Entire CLI configuration\n│   ├── metadata/               # Session metadata (gitignored)\n│   └── opencode/\n│       ├── config.json         # Plugin configuration\n│       └── sessions/           # Exported transcripts\n│           └── <session-id>/\n│               ├── transcript.jsonl\n│               └── metadata.json\n├── .git/\n│   └── entire-sessions/        # Session state files\n└── opencode.json               # OpenCode config with plugin\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Plugin doesn't load\n\n**Symptom:** No session tracking, no error messages\n\n**Solution:**\n- Check OpenCode logs: `opencode --debug`\n- Verify plugin in `opencode.json`: `\"plugin\": [\"opencode-entire-integration\"]`\n- Reinstall: `bun add opencode-entire-integration`\n\n### \"Entire CLI not found\" error\n\n**Symptom:** Error message on OpenCode startup\n\n```\n╭─────────────────────────────────────────────────╮\n│  ⚠️  Entire CLI not found                       │\n╰─────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\n```\n\n**Solution:**\n```bash\ngo install entire.io/cli/cmd/entire@latest\n```\n\n### \"Entire CLI not configured\" warning\n\n**Symptom:** Warning message on OpenCode startup\n\n**Solution:**\n```bash\ncd /path/to/your/project\nentire setup\n```\n\n### Hook execution fails\n\n**Symptom:** Errors in OpenCode logs about hook failures\n\n**Solution:**\n- Check git repository status: `git status`\n- Check Entire CLI status: `entire opencode status` (coming soon)\n- Check logs: Look for `[entire-integration]` messages in OpenCode output\n- Increase timeout: Set `hook_timeout_ms` higher in config\n\n## Development\n\n### Setup\n\n```bash\ngit clone https://github.com/entireio/opencode-entire-integration\ncd opencode-entire-integration\nbun install\n```\n\n### Build\n\n```bash\nbun run build\n```\n\n### Test\n\n```bash\n# Run all tests\nbun test\n\n# Run tests in watch mode\nbun test --watch\n\n# Run with coverage\nbun test --coverage\n```\n\n### Lint\n\n```bash\n# Check for issues\nbun run lint\n\n# Fix issues automatically\nbun run lint:fix\n\n# Check formatting\nbun run format:check\n\n# Format code\nbun run format\n```\n\n### Type Check\n\n```bash\nbun run typecheck\n```\n\n## Architecture\n\n### Plugin Structure\n\n```\nsrc/\n├── index.ts                    # Main plugin entry\n├── types.ts                    # TypeScript definitions\n├── hooks/\n│   └── session.ts              # Session lifecycle hooks\n├── export/\n│   └── transcript.ts           # Transcript export\n├── cli/\n│   └── entire.ts               # Entire CLI wrapper\n└── utils/\n    ├── logger.ts               # Logging utilities\n    └── config.ts               # Configuration management\n```\n\n### Event Flow\n\n1. **OpenCode event** → `session.created`\n2. **Plugin hook** → `onSessionCreated()`\n3. **Export transcript** → `.entire/opencode/sessions/<id>/transcript.jsonl`\n4. **Call Entire CLI** → `entire hooks opencode session-start`\n5. **Git operation** → Create checkpoint on shadow branch\n6. **Result** → Session tracked in `entire logs`\n\n## Roadmap\n\n### Phase 1: MVP (Current)\n- ✅ Basic session tracking\n- ✅ Transcript export\n- ✅ Error handling\n- ✅ Tests and linting\n\n### Phase 2: Task Tracking\n- ⏳ Pre-task hooks (before subagent spawn)\n- ⏳ Post-task hooks (after subagent completion)\n- ⏳ Subagent transcript linking\n- ⏳ Task hierarchy in logs\n\n### Phase 3: Enhanced Metadata\n- ⏳ Todo content extraction\n- ⏳ User prompt tracking\n- ⏳ Rich checkpoint descriptions\n\n### Phase 4: Production\n- ⏳ NPM package publication\n- ⏳ Performance optimization\n- ⏳ Comprehensive documentation\n- ⏳ CI/CD pipeline\n\n## Contributing\n\nContributions welcome! Please:\n\n1. Fork the repository\n2. Create a feature branch\n3. Add tests for new functionality\n4. Ensure linting passes: `bun run lint`\n5. Submit a pull request\n\n## License\n\nMIT\n\n## Links\n\n- [Entire CLI](https://entire.io/cli)\n- [OpenCode](https://opencode.ai)\n- [Documentation](../cli/docs/README-opencode-integration.md)\n- [Issues](https://github.com/entireio/opencode-entire-integration/issues)\n\n## Support\n\n- GitHub Issues: Report bugs and feature requests\n- Documentation: See `docs/` directory in Entire CLI repo\n- Discord: (coming soon)\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":258,"oldLines":7,"newStart":258,"newLines":7,"lines":[" "," 1. **OpenCode event** → `session.created`"," 2. **Plugin hook** → `onSessionCreated()`","-3. **Export transcript** → `.entire/opencode/sessions/<id>/transcript.jsonl`","+3. **Export transcript** → `.entire/tmp/opencode/sessions/<id>/transcript.jsonl`"," 4. **Call Entire CLI** → `entire hooks opencode session-start`"," 5. **Git operation** → Create checkpoint on shadow branch"," 6. **Result** → Session tracked in `entire logs`"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"24235ae8-3023-4d32-92b3-b7b4df93f251"}
